    "description": "Classic piano games just got fine-tuned! Play the popular, top piano game Piano Tiles 2\u2122 and tap to play your favorite tunes!\r\n\r\nTest your rhythmic reaction skills in addicting, challenging levels, get cool bonuses and try limited-time events.\r\n\r\nTap musical tiles to play piano songs in this modern upgrade to the classic addictive piano game. Make piano music like magic when you tap the black tiles, progressing through piano levels. But be careful, DON'T TOUCH THE WHITE TILES!\r\n\r\nTap to the beat with 1.1 BILLION players around the world! Download Piano Tiles 2\u2122 today!\r\n\r\n=== Piano Tiles 2\u2122 features ===\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb9 <b>PIANO MUSIC GAME</b> \ud83c\udfb9\r\n- Tap along to over 700+ songs!\r\n- Classical piano tunes you know and love\r\n- Folk music favorites from around the world\r\n- Original tracks from other players (send us yours!)\r\n- Fire new hits with music added often!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 <b>EVENTS & CHALLENGES</b> \ud83c\udfb5\r\n- Tap through bonus challenges & become a star!\r\n- Earn rewards for completing daily missions & events\r\n- Leaderboard challenges: see how you stack up worldwide!\r\n- Key in your coordination with accompaniments, double tiles, sliders & more!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfbc <b>MUSICAL GAME MODES</b> \ud83c\udfb6\r\n- Play piano with progressively challenging levels: are you Chopsticks or Chopin?\r\n- Classic Piano Tiles gameplay for retro game lovers\r\n- New modes like slider, combo tile & double tile\r\n- Speed mode for beginners, skilled players, and masters\r\n- Level up to unlock new tracks & gameplay\r\n- Casual game with challenging modes- keep up with the keys!\r\n\r\n\u26a1 <b>PIANO POWER-UPS & MORE</b> \u26a1\r\n- Power-up your game with props!\r\n- Protect white tile taps, freeze time & more\r\n- Jazz out too hard and tap the wrong tile? Use a revive!\r\n- Lucky Spins for more props, new tracks & more rewards!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10 <b>PLAY ONLINE OR OFFLINE</b> \ud83d\udeab\r